  "keyFeatures": [
    "Live PostgreSQL schema grounding — column types, FK graphs, and relationships are always current",
    "System model — a typed dependency graph of the product repo that answers what connects to what and why",
    "Six-phase harness loop: discuss → plan → execute → test → review → ship, each with a human approval gate",
    "PVT prep track for Production Verification Test SQL script generation",
    "Claude Code and Codex plugin support — bring your own LLM runtime",
    "Chat GUI with SSE streaming, vault file management, and local project folder attachment",
    "Engineering decision records — captured reasoning persisted alongside the code graph",
    "Jira MCP integration for ticket and user story context",
    "Mintlify documentation search grounding via search_docs and get_doc_page tools",
    "Flexible model routing — Bifrost gateway, direct Anthropic, or local Ollama"
  ],
